  "term": "athletic type",
  "definition": "Athletic type refers to a sports-related or sport-like mechanism of injury. In this packet, it means injuries considered consistent with athletic trauma and is estimated indirectly using cases grouped under falls and other exposure to mechanical forces when a specific sports-injury category is not available.",
